# Fetched CLI sidecar binaries + SBOMs (see CLI_SIDECAR in
# src-tauri/src/cli_bridge.rs and bundle.externalBin in tauri.conf.json).
# Pinned + checksummed via src-tauri/binaries/vendor-manifest.json, which IS
# committed. Fetch with `npm run fetch:sidecars`; re-verify without
# re-downloading via `npm run verify:sidecars`.
/src-tauri/binaries/omnideck-*
/src-tauri/binaries/sbom/*.json

